{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj3vMHcHLv2sQCokSyh4","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*You stand before me — a simple, weathered door set into a stone frame.*\n\n*There is a single keyhole, tarnished brass, at my center.*\n\n*I do not speak. I do not move. But you feel it — the waiting. The patient, ancient waiting of something that has been locked for a very long time.*\n\n*A cold draft breathes through the keyhole.*\n\n*You hear, from the other side, something that might be silence — or might be something holding its breath.*\n\n🔑🕳️\n\n*Do you have the key?*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":32,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":129,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}